rong><br>Enter the Arena! Here, one-on-one duels are held non-stop, unleashing thrilling PVP battles amidst passionate cheers! Showcase your unique strategies to other Hyperlinkers, enjoy the purest intellectual competition, and realize your dream of heated battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084970/extras/312e319081d472e49654338969f6c257.poster.avif?t=1740645092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084970/extras/312e319081d472e49654338969f6c257.webm?t=1740645092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084970/extras/312e319081d472e49654338969f6c257.mp4?t=1740645092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Delve Deep into the Threshold and Confront the Infected Head-On]</strong><br>The world of Etheria offers rich PVE content. The powerful enemies encountered in the Main Quest will reappear in the Threshold, GP Outpost, and Investigations. Team up with your Animus squad to defeat these bosses! Of course, powerful Hyperlinkers won't be satisfied with just this. Venture deeper into the Ruins, where more dangerous and mysterious enemies await your challenge...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084970/extras/cfb2fa77b8af0d42c19c0ddd7772bec9.poster.avif?t=1740645092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084970/extras/cfb2fa77b8af0d42c19c0ddd7772bec9.webm?t=1740645092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084970/extras/cfb2fa77b8af0d42c19c0ddd7772bec9.mp4?t=